West Cork Construction & Maintenance Ltd is a local construction company serving homeowners and businesses across West Cork.

We take on projects of all sizes, including new builds, roofing, renovations, extensions and ongoing property maintenance. Every job is approached with the same level of care, professionalism and attention to detail, ensuring our clients receive a service they can trust.

Our goal is simple — to deliver quality work, honest advice and a finished result that meets your expectations.

